<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>1000x1000</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Mili</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">1000x1000</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3GDSxNv7UIMbuU0BiYXv2K</ttm:item><itunes:duration>04:20.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.330" end="00:10.830">Memories</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.750" end="00:13.030">You keep me strong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.030" end="00:14.550">Shutter down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.550" end="00:16.610">Laminated sheets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.610" end="00:20.120">Sealing up our rosy cheeks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.120" end="00:22.380">You bring me along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.380" end="00:24.440">From sunset to dawn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.440" end="00:25.980">Our dreams</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.980" end="00:28.310">Melt into candy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.310" end="00:34.600">A million billion stars</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.600" end="00:40.250">Tulila tulila ta</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.250" end="00:41.750">No matter how far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.650" end="00:46.360">Nights will never be dark</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.360" end="00:52.180">Tulalila talilula lila</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.180" end="00:53.680">You and I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.040" end="00:54.540">We are one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.170" end="00:55.670">We are one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.340" end="00:56.930">We will always be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.930" end="00:58.430">You and I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.710" end="00:59.210">We are one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.850" end="01:00.350">We are one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.060" end="01:01.560">We will always be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.530" end="01:03.030">You and I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.410" end="01:03.910">We are one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.600" end="01:05.100">We are one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.770" end="01:06.270">We will always be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.240" end="01:07.740">You and I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.170" end="01:08.670">We are one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.300" end="01:09.800">We are one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.440" end="01:12.850">We are always</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.850" end="01:15.430">For you I'm dashing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.430" end="01:17.820">For you I'm searching</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.820" end="01:19.320">For you I cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.980" end="01:20.480">For you I smile</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.100" end="01:22.430">For you I still remain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.430" end="01:24.730">For you I'm fighting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.730" end="01:29.590">For you I got 1000 of fractures</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.590" end="01:37.590">For you I'll do it 1000 times more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.720" end="01:50.750">Yeah I know this all sounds cliché</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.750" end="01:53.060">But you see it's true what they always say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.060" end="01:55.390">You never really know how good you had it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.390" end="01:57.750">Till you lose the ones you love one day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.750" end="01:59.250">I wanna trade</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.290" end="02:00.070">Trade my eyes trade my arms trade my legs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.070" end="02:02.410">Trade my heart trade my blood trade my brains</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.410" end="02:04.810">Trade my anything just to see you again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.810" end="02:06.840">You're my everything from the start till end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.840" end="02:08.340">Darling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.440" end="02:08.940">Tell me tell me why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.290" end="02:10.060">Tell me tell me why are we here?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.060" end="02:12.390">Far away far away from our motherland</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.390" end="02:14.760">Are we damned from believing in numbers?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.760" end="02:17.130">Maybe then They should have made us dumber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.130" end="02:19.530">Geniuses leading us to this moment</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.530" end="02:22.700">Kisses fundamental to human expansion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.700" end="02:24.460">Take me to the bitter end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.460" end="02:25.960">Take me to the bitter end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.690" end="02:27.190">Memories</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.160" end="02:29.490">You keep me strong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.490" end="02:31.020">Shutter down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.020" end="02:33.070">Laminated sheets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.070" end="02:36.580">Sealing up our rosy cheeks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.580" end="02:38.850">You bring me along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.850" end="02:41.030">From sunset to dawn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.030" end="02:42.540">Our dreams</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.540" end="02:45.270">Melt into candy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.270" end="02:47.720">You are my source of fears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.720" end="02:49.600">Inner wars</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.600" end="02:51.860">Lying to myself lying to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.860" end="02:54.310">"Whatever doesn't hurt"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.310" end="03:01.330">Even if torture will never be worthy of answers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.330" end="03:06.160">For you I'll do it 1000 times more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.160" end="03:08.140">Huh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.140" end="03:10.680">For you I'm falling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.680" end="03:13.030">For you I'm drowning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.030" end="03:14.530">For you I'm bruised</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.210" end="03:15.710">For you I'm healed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.390" end="03:17.770">For you I am in flames</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.770" end="03:20.080">For you I'm flying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.080" end="03:24.810">For you I'd go 1000 times faster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.810" end="03:32.810">For you I'd go 1000 times faster</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.470" end="03:42.470">For you I'll do it 1000 times more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:43.620" end="03:46.590">For you I'll do it 1000 times more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:46.590" end="03:50.960">1000x1000x1000x1000x</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:50.960" end="03:55.670">1000x1000x1000x1000x</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:55.670" end="03:59.670">1000x1000x1000x1000x</p></div></body></tt>